        <li><strong>If you run a large team</strong>: {largeQuoteOnly} of the {largeTeamTools.length} platforms whose listed best-fit team size reaches past 50 people publish no price, so book demos with several of them and compare written quotes.</li>
        <li><strong>If you're on Xero</strong>: {withXero} platforms list a Xero integration, among them {xeroExamples}, against {withQuickBooks} for QuickBooks.</li>
        <li><strong>If you do insurance restoration work</strong>: CompanyCam, a photo documentation platform, is listed as integrating with {companyCamPartnerTools.length} platforms in the directory ({companyCamPartners}); check whether your FSM is one of them.</li>
        <li><strong>If you're solo or 1-2 techs</strong>: Joist (from ${joistPricing?.starting_at_usd}/mo {joistPricing?.tiers[0]}) and Markate (from about ${Math.round(markatePricing?.starting_at_usd ?? 0)}/mo) are low-cost starting points before committing to mid-tier FSM; check each plan's limits.</li>
